			"notes": "Having reached this milestone of items, functionalities and usability of the mod i believe i can finally declare its entrance in the Beta phase. All core functionality from 1.5.2 and 1.7.10 has been, to my knowledge as of writing this, achieved. \n\nAll that remains is to bugtest and add the remaining items that were either WIP or lost in the files, which will either remain ignored or implemented to the best of my interpretation (of course still close to the apparent original mod's intentions)\n\n+Added Dark and Proto Matter\n+Added the full Dark matter arsenal (pending armor)\n+Added proper functionality to the Philosophers Stone\n+Added Sounds\n+Added the functionality of charging certain items (V to charge and Shift+V to discharge)\n\n-Bug Fixes here and there too, together with some better data structures so the mod consumes \"less\" processing power"
		},
