			"notes": "I have updated Project3, adding the following:\n\n+3 tiers of Alchemical Chests: inventories like Alchemical bags, cheaper (at the 3rd stage, and also not needing bundles to craft) but not as portable. Contrary to Alchemical bags though, each inventory is unique, thus not behaving like a \"virtual ender chest\" as the bags did, and have EMC, thus allowing for scaleability.\n\n+Italian Full translations\n+Russian Partial translations"
